sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SRC as Alert Source<br/>(webhook / email / API)
    participant API as ISOC API<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant W as ARQ Worker<br/>(orchestrator)
    participant N as Normalizer<br/>(alert-memory-mcp)
    participant E as bge-m3<br/>(Ollama embedder)
    participant Q as Qdrant<br/>(vector DB)
    participant TI as Enrichment<br/>(triage.py + TI feeds)
    participant AC as Auto-Close<br/>(YAML rules)
    participant B as briefing.py
    participant LLM as LLM<br/>(Seneca / LiteLLM)
    participant DB as Postgres

    SRC->>API: POST /webhooks/{source} (HMAC-signed alert)
    API->>W: enqueue pipeline_run(alert)
    W->>N: normalize(raw_alert)
    N-->>W: NORMALIZED {fields, embed_text}

    rect rgb(40, 30, 60)
    Note over W,Q: RAG retrieval — semantic memory of past verdicts
    W->>E: embed(embed_text)
    E-->>W: dense vector (1024d)
    W->>Q: hybrid_search(dense + sparse, k=10)
    Q-->>W: EXACT_MATCH (score ≥ 0.90)
    Q-->>W: N_WAY agreement (≥ 3/5 priors)
    Q-->>W: SIMILAR (top-10 prior cases + verdicts)
    W->>Q: kb_search(embed_text)
    Q-->>W: KB_HITS (runbooks / allowlists / assets)
    end

    par Parallel enrichment
        W->>TI: triage(extracted IOCs)
        TI-->>W: VT / AbuseIPDB / OTX / MalwareBazaar / ThreatFox
    and
        W->>TI: whois / rDNS / passive-DNS
        TI-->>W: IP_ENRICHMENT
    and
        W->>TI: local feed match (~91k IOCs)
        TI-->>W: THREAT_INTEL_MATCHES
    end

    W->>AC: evaluate(normalized + enrichment)
    AC-->>W: AUTOCLOSE_VERDICT (pre / post) or none

    W->>B: render(normalized, RAG hits, enrichment, autoclose, temporal)
    B-->>W: BRIEFING (markdown, capped sections)

    rect rgb(30, 50, 40)
    Note over W,LLM: Tier-1 — fast classifier (cheap / local)
    W->>LLM: complete(FAST_CLASSIFIER, briefing)
    LLM-->>W: {verdict, confidence, reason} (JSON)
    end

    alt Confident AND corroboration gate passes (exact≥0.9 / n_way≥3 / autoclose)
        W->>W: short-circuit — skip deep synthesis (cap cost)
    else Ambiguous, sensitive rule, or any TP
        rect rgb(30, 50, 40)
        Note over W,LLM: Tier-2 — deep synthesis
        W->>LLM: complete(SYSTEM_PROMPT, briefing)
        LLM-->>W: SOC analyst report (markdown)
        end
        W->>W: hallucination check (report IOCs ⊆ briefing IOCs)
    end

    rect rgb(40, 30, 60)
    Note over W,Q: RAG feedback loop — today's verdict becomes tomorrow's prior
    W->>E: embed(case + verdict)
    E-->>W: vector
    W->>Q: upsert(alert, verdict, human_verified flag)
    end

    W->>DB: persist incident + enrichment + llm_calls + transcript
    DB-->>API: status = awaiting_review
    API-->>SRC: 200 OK
